                                "sense_id": "469af5f8-44c9-3c1c-a84f-7ac946f5aa29",
                                "text": "Wo be to you scrybes, and pharises ypocrites, for ye are lyke unto paynted tombes which appere beautyfull outwardes: but are within full off deed mens bones and of all fylthynes."
